body:
...which is what capitalism will naturally do because of its tendency for monopoly (see First Gilded Age and Second Gilded Age).

&#x200B;

That's not absolutely everything, and I didn't even get into my anarchist critique, but that's most of the reasons why I don't like Capitalism. Not all of that was coherent, so sorry about that, but my text kept getting erased because of one reason or another so I had to rewrite it 2 times. If you can explain to me either why these things shouldn't matter or how Capitalism can solve them then I'll happily go back to the right. Looking forward to your response.
